        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "This game tells a story of heart-to-heart connections and salvation surrounding Mono, a girl who visits the medical facility “Ishokan” in hopes of saving her older sister, who has been afflicted by the terrifying “Shinigami Disease”; Melhendia, a goat-like creature who seeks to exploit her; and the girls who the disease have transformed into strange creatures.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Esta historia narra conexiones de corazón a corazón y de salvación en torno a Mono, una niña que visita el centro médico «Ishokan» con la esperanza de salvar a su hermana mayor, afligida por la aterradora «Enfermedad Shinigami»; Melhendia, una criatura similar a una cabra que pretende aprovecharse de ella; y las chicas que la enfermedad ha transformado en extrañas criaturas.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
